[Music]  halo 5 Guardians may have released last  year but developer 343 industries is  still hard at work maintaining the  shooter as of now the studio has updated  halo 5 with eight updates adding classic  multiplayer modes such as firefight and  big team battle but also larger  additions such as Forge the franchise's  long-running level creation tool and now  with Halo 5s ninth update on the horizon  Ford is making its way to PC welcome to  forge this changes a few things most  notably forges controls are deeper than  ever with mouse and keyboard inputs  allowing for precise edits and  mathematical changes you can click and  drag objects rotate walls and ceilings  and manually change object effects such  as the launching distance of man cannons  bringing the level creator to PC pose a  serious challenge for 343 not only did  the developer need to make the controls  more accessible for players accustomed  to console commands but also add the  death inherent to mouse and keyboard  input it's a paradox that 343 studio  head josh homme said was difficult to  solve  but once figured out led to much more  refinement in the complex mode you know  so one of the big goals for us by  bringing Forge to PC is just having the  precision of mouse and keyboard and you  know being able to very rapidly create  content and take advantage of all of the  features that are there within forge  just makes for an even better experience  building content Forge has always given  you a hammer and chisel now you have a  power saw to forge on PC also improves  the ease and speed with which you can  share your creations  Anvil's legacy features a forge library  of user created content complete with a  nuanced search filter and thumbnail  generator you can find a plethora of  creations ranging from Star Wars  inspired levels to giant foosball table  maps  lastly you can play through any of your  forged creations through Windows 10 that  is you can play Halo 5 custom  multiplayer games on PC with mouse and  keyboard controls  Slayer three four three has yet to  confirm whether the entirety of halo 5  will be ported to PC but as of now you  can take control of a Spartan with a  more precise control scheme playing  through yours and your friends maps with  your own weapon set skill counts and  time limits the mode SWAT feels  particularly at home here as you line up  headshots and quick bursts from your  battle rifle forges new home on PC is  part of a wider effort by 343 to keep  the blood pumping through Halo fives  veins I think for us when you look at  this this tool it is so powerful and our  hope is that we're going to be able to  have players come in that may have been  you know intimidated by Forge in the  past but now with some of the tutorials  that we have they can start to build  that capacity as creators and valenki  will also bring a free Halo app to  Windows 10 complete with trailers videos  and forum for Halo players to peruse so  although Halo 5 may have released in  2015 it's still very much alive at least  insofar as 343 keeps supporting it and  VLEs legacy is the next push in that  effort it adds more depth to forge it  adds sharing options to keep the  community connected it adds classic  shooter controls to the franchise's  customizable multiplayer matches Forge  has always been about fostering  creativity but now halo 5 players can  help maintain the pulse as well you're  going to see even more content come into  the mix and even more things for people  to be able to play with in the game so  I'm really excited to see you know what  people do with these tools and then  we're going to continue to support and  expand them over time  [Music]  you

